      "content": "That makes sense. If the lecithin is aggregating because of the hydrogen bonding you mentioned, how does that impact the actual viscosity of the emulsion? We're seeing the texture get quite thin right before the separation happens. Is there a way to optimize the surfactant concentration to prevent that specific film breakdown?",
